<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN MONDAY SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN MONDAY SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of play on the show</p>
<p>courts on the first day of the US$7.6 million Australian Open</p>
<p>tennis tournament on Monday (prefix denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Centre Court (2345 GMT Sunday start)</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) v Janette Husarova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>15-Michael Stich (Germany) v Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden)</p>
<p>6-Boris Becker (Germany) v Carlos Moya (Spain)</p>
<p>Night session (0800 GMT start)</p>
<p>13-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) v Mary Pierce (France)</p>
<p>Pat Cash (Australia) v Javier Frana (Argentina)</p>
<p>Court One (2300 GMT Sunday start)</p>
<p>Mark Knowles (Bahamas) v Todd Woodbridge (Australia)</p>
<p>Anna Kournikova (Russia) v 12-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
<p>Annabel Ellwood (Australia) v Lori McNeil (U.S.)</p>
<p>Court Two (2300 GMT Sunday start)</p>
<p>Kris Goossens (Belgium) v 2-Michael Chang (U.S.)</p>
<p>3-Conchita Martinez (Spain) v Miriam Oremans (Netherlands)</p>
<p>7-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) v Nicolas Pereira (Venezuala)</p>
<p>Els Callens (Belgium) v Gigi Fernandez (U.S.)</p>
